.. note::
    :func:`torch.nonzero(..., as_tuple=False) <torch.nonzero>` (default) returns a
    2-D tensor where each row is the index for a nonzero value.

    :func:`torch.nonzero(..., as_tuple=True) <torch.nonzero>` returns a tuple of 1-D
